we'll give you two lines of it's negative.

00:01:07.358 --> 00:01:09.694
It's a red line that's going to come out

00:01:12.530 --> 00:01:14.574
So that red line right there

00:01:15.450 --> 00:01:18.328
in the first package,
we just popped over and that's positive.

00:01:19.537 --> 00:01:22.916
So the next test right now
will open some packages,

00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:25.168
make sure that they're
the same contents are different.

00:01:25.210 --> 00:01:28.379
If it's different tested
with different type of test.

00:01:30.799 --> 00:01:31.424
So right now

00:01:31.424 --> 00:01:35.011
on the opening, we just see that it looks
a second to the same, the first package.

00:01:35.303 --> 00:01:37.931
So we can assume
that is the same kind of narcotic

00:01:51.861 --> 00:01:54.197
All the substances look the same.

00:01:54.405 --> 00:01:55.865
They are all small pills.

00:01:55.865 --> 00:01:57.826
Even in the packages look different.

00:01:57.826 --> 00:02:01.955
They have the same aura narcotic inside
conceal inside.

00:02:03.039 --> 00:02:06.084
Now we need to weigh them
to see how much narcotics we have

00:02:10.004 --> 00:02:12.048
1.86 kilograms.

00:02:16.553 --> 00:02:18.888
It was a good day whenever you are able
to seize any type of narcotic.

00:02:19.514 --> 00:02:22.350
The further it leaves Nogales,
